    - ``add_bias_kv`` is ``False``
    - ``add_zero_attn`` is ``False``
    - ``kdim`` and ``vdim`` are equal to ``embed_dim``
    - if a `NestedTensor <https://pytorch.org/docs/stable/nested.html>`_ is passed, neither ``key_padding_mask``
      nor ``attn_mask`` is passed
